      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/drawers/today.props.ts",
      "content": "The last replay session is not necessarily the exit session. Market Data returns only completed sessions, so a trade sold out during today's session can already be Closed while the replay still ends yesterday (or is empty for a same-day round trip). This labels today's exit price with yesterday's date and selects yesterday's underlying mark. Derive the exit-session heading from the terminal event/session rather than the last available replay entry, and select the underlying mark for that session, showing a gap until it is available. Add a test for closure before the exit session completes.",
